          {
            "step": 0,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-401-14cbd7e6/proxy/tool/story/?act=0&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nOBSERVE\nInfrastructure health is not service health\n×\nInfrastructure health is not service health\nA PLANNED MIGRATION CAN COMPLETE WHILE THE APPLICATION OR ITS AI DEPENDENCY STILL FAILS.\n01 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 1,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-401-14cbd7e6/proxy/tool/story/?act=1&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nPREFLIGHT\nQualify the operation before proposing it\n\nEach answer is observed evidence, never an assumption.\n\n1\nIdentity\n2\nCompatibility\n3\nEvidence\n4\nAuthority\nAUDIENCE QUESTION\nIs this the declared VM?\nReveal technical boundary\nactive request and evidence path\ndeployment or trust boundary\noptional integration\nAUTHORITY\nHuman operator\nrequests and explicitly approves an operation\nGOVERNED OPERATIONS BOUNDARY\nnamespaced candidate; no cluster mutation authority\nsnapshot\n→\nEVIDENCE\nObserved state\ncurrent identity, compatibility, and health\nevaluate\n→\nPOLICY\nDeterministic policy\nALLOW_REVIEW · REFUSE · ABSTAIN\nrecord\n→\nDEPLOYMENT\nOperations adapter\nrecords evidence; never remediates\nPOST /api/v1/operations\nauthorize review\n→\nAUTHORITY\nApproval gate\nhuman · digest · expiry\nobserved result\n→\nEXTERNAL\nExternal operation\nmigration or recovery remains outside adapter authority\nhealth\n→\nSERVICE\nApplication + AI path\nvalidated separately from infrastructure\nlearn\n→\nDATA\nDurable evidence "
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-401-14cbd7e6/proxy/tool/story/?act=2&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nPROPOSE\nA passing preflight is a proposal, not permission\nThe checks passed\n→\nALLOW_REVIEW · HUMAN_APPROVAL_REQUIRED\n\nThe operation digest freezes exactly what the reviewer is asked to approve.\n\n03 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-401-14cbd7e6/proxy/tool/story/?act=3&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\nAPPROVE\nAuthority stays with the operator\nMAY APPROVE THE EXACT OPERATION DIGEST\nHuman authority\nnamed reviewer\nexpiry\naccept or reject\nMAY EVALUATE AND RECORD ONLY\nAdapter authority\ndeterministic policy\ndurable evidence\nno remediation\nNONE\nModel authority\noptional explanation\nno decision override\nno infrastructure action\n04 · 1/1"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "url": "https://labs.smg-helix.ai/labs/virtualization-ai-401-14cbd7e6/proxy/tool/story/?act=4&scene=0",
            "text": "×\n←\n→\nP\n⛶\n1\nPlanned migration validates\n2\nAI dependency is unavailable\n3\nInfrastructure succeeds, application fails\nGOVERNED REHEARSAL\nStart with one approved operation\nPreserve the exact digest, observed result, source state, and human authority.\nINPUT\nGoverned operation request\nOne typed contract separates the platform operation, application health, AI dependency, and correlated evidence.\nInspect technical topology\nRun governed operation conditions\nAUTHORITY\nExecution remains human-owned\n\nThe adapter records an external operation result. It never migrates, restores, or remediates a workload.\n\nALLOW_REVIEW permits inspection; it never authorizes certification or promotion.\n05 · 1/1"
          },
